# One Move

Use the public One Move API, MCP servers and discovery documents. Read AGENTS.md first.

- API docs: https://getonemove.app/docs/api
- MCP docs: https://getonemove.app/docs/mcp
- llms.txt: https://getonemove.app/llms.txt
- auth.md: https://getonemove.app/auth.md
- Sandbox: https://api.getonemove.app/v1/sandbox/reports/chesscom/example

Never put a player's email, username or raw games into a prompt. Public reads need no key.
